Description: Provides tools for the design of clinical trials. Supports block
    randomization with or without stratification, export of randomization and
    correspondence lists in formats compatible with Ennov and REDCap, and
    sample size calculation for superiority and non-inferiority trials on
    continuous and binary endpoints, including cluster randomized trials (CRT,
    baseline period, and stepped-wedge designs).
